# SAUNA alone, the Corrigida's arcade game (`--fix all`: `sauna_arcade_rules`,
# `sauna_controls_screen`; docs/sauna/PACMAN.md): the controls screen (a key takes it
# down at 1100), a second of READY, then 46 arrow presses, planned by
# `tools/sauna_plan.py --arcade --start 1100 --min-eaten 1` (the planner runs the
# game's own clock and simulation: the ghosts have no randomness but the
# frightened ones', from a fixed seed). Most presses come a tile before a
# junction (the direction is kept until the first moment it can be taken: the
# arcade's pre-turn) and he never meets a ghost but one, eaten under the
# power of a cork (+500); the last dot goes at 41612 and SAUNA reports won
# 11100 (9600 + 500 + 1000). Rerun the planner when SAUNA's start moves.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame sauna --headless --ms 43000 --fix all --input tools/play/sauna-corrigida-arcade-win.input
